{"id":"vod_sn_38638","vodId":"38638","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"DAYS","name_cn":"DAYS","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e3ca0c3dc01f14124775f24bff10e8fd.jpg"},"summary":"本柄尽（吉永拓斗 配音）是一名平凡的少年，无论是个性还是样貌，都可以用“毫无特点”四个字形容，他的生活，亦和他的个性一样平淡无波澜。某日，本柄尽结识了名为风间阵（松冈祯丞 配音）的同龄少年，这阴差阳错的相遇彻底改变了本柄尽的命运。　　在风间阵的带领之下，本柄尽开始接触到了五人制足球比赛，并且进入行业内赫赫有名的足球学校圣迹高中就读，加入了校内的足球队。尽管本柄尽对这项热血的运动毫无经验，但很快他便在激烈的竞赛之中展现出了永不言弃的可贵特质。木讷的守门员水树寿人（浪川大辅 配音）、沉默寡言的君下敦（小野大辅 配音）、大大咧咧的大柴喜一（宫野真守 配音），在队友们的信赖中，本柄尽和球队一起，向对手发起了挑战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EWGHg55sc71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0GGDq8zWmG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K181a7Ncte1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u57G4HT3cn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XwMB2t8seA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MQJJvSGkB41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fcVGfek7Md1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v0QkpfiJL81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CQjqaJ29uy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P91D62dMUj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HcSAcBKREq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nSBCe7AcUs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vGwym51mwH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1CVVtUdV0z1/video/index.m3u